      "title": "How it works",
      "properties": {
        "ue_properties": {
          "widget_ue_connectable": {},
          "version": "8.0.1",
          "input_ue_unconnectable": {}
        }
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Load Qwen3.5 with Load CLIP (type stable_diffusion; the loader detects the model).\n2. In the chat panel, click the card upload button to add a character card (PNG or JSON), or a refmod .safetensors. Press refresh after adding files by hand. Cards live in input/characters; refmods in models/refmods.\n3. Pick the character and type a message. Each message queues the workflow.\n4. Save chat writes the conversation to output/chats as .txt and .json. The chat is also kept inside this workflow, so save the workflow (Ctrl+S) to resume later.\n5. Need a character? The Character Creator workflow writes one from a concept."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "1. Load Qwen3.5 with Load CLIP (type stable_diffusion; the loader detects the model).\n2. In the chat panel, click the card upload button to add a character card (PNG or JSON), or a refmod .safetensors. Press refresh after adding files by hand. Cards live in input/characters; refmods in models/refmods.\n3. Pick the character and type a message. Each message queues the workflow.\n4. Save chat writes the conversation to output/chats as .txt and .json. The chat is also kept inside this workflow, so save the workflow (Ctrl+S) to resume later.\n5. Need a character? The Character Creator workflow writes one from a concept."
      },
